28
00:02:37,255 --> 00:02:37,957
Scott: narrowest

29
00:02:37,997 --> 00:02:50,860
Rym: specific issue was there was a bug in the microcode of i7s and 99s from the 13th and 14th generation where if you overclocked, you're just fucked and your chip's fucked.

30
00:02:51,281 --> 00:03:03,000
