50
00:05:33,103 --> 00:05:33,838
Rym: Well, you need electricity.

51
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:37,159
Scott: Breathe on the computer, breathe the BIOS on to it.

52
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:44,659
