53
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:53,320
Rym: And it looked like that, I rebooted, and everything was fine, and then I used the Microsoft tool, sorry, the Intel tool, to look at my microcode version.

54
00:05:53,802 --> 00:05:55,620
