134
00:13:25,602 --> 00:13:28,640
Scott: But they got entangled with it, obviously.

135
00:13:29,340 --> 00:13:31,700
Scott: And it's sort of like, you know, that whole discussion.

136
00:13:31,781 --> 00:13:33,158
Scott: But even before then, right?

137
00:13:33,582 --> 00:13:36,740
