142
00:13:55,203 --> 00:14:00,940
Scott: But also, not just the software they sell, but, you know, the company itself, right?

143
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,080
Scott: How secure are their operations, right?

144
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:05,560
Scott: They're a very, you know, important company.

145
00:14:05,681 --> 00:14:10,840
Scott: If someone can, you know, do anything to Microsoft, they can impact the entire world, right?

146
00:14:11,161 --> 00:14:19,520
