148
00:14:25,481 --> 00:14:31,000
Scott: Any security vulnerabilities in those are way more devastating than in any other things.

149
00:14:31,321 --> 00:14:37,479
Scott: And there's a lot more people in the world trying to, you know, actually maliciously target things.

150
00:14:37,961 --> 00:14:43,060
